Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room looks like it was on\Nthe receiving end of a tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how this hole\Ncould be perfectly spherical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but the destruction\Nspreads into the other room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say Avdol and the\Nothers made contact with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break down this door, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going in! Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.52,0:00:37.36,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pleasure to be able to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.74,0:01:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the memory? Who poo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hula!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:01:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hula! Hula!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All River!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.05,0:02:34.56,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,689)\pos(135,858)}Episode 44: The Miasma of the Void, Cool Ice, Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, the blood that stains my\Nbody is Avdol's handiwork, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan was to eradicate you both\Nsimultaneously, but due to Avdol's intervention,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your demise was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else would have instinctively\Nsaved himself over risking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life and limb to come to the\Naid of an oblivious comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That alone makes him\Nresponsible for my injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have been able to injure me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it'll take far more than\Nthat to send me to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll set my sights\Non the other interlopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them in the name of Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to use your stand, Iggy,\Nbut you just had to show off, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as Cool Ice was concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy was nothing more than a filthy\Nstray without resolve or pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But by its very nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a stand is a manifestation of the soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Iggy's had acted of its own volition,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with something compelling\Nit from deep within.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His sand...its spirit is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is a lifeless husk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shell of death is in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another life has been\Ncut short far too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one who survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too slow for\Nyour own good, Cool Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had some pretty selfless friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to look out for\NIggy, but instead he saved my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this be happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only just begun to\Nrealize what he meant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it until after they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a miserable little mutt\Nfrom the start, but despite that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you never failed to find\Nnew ways to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a proud bastard who\Nlived life by your own rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were the ones who mistook\Nyour self-respect as indifference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Fleabag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to be so stubborn?
