Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured out what you are, Cool Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something\Nstrange about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio somehow found a way to transform you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, your precious master made\Nthe changes without your knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave you his blood, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he left out the part about\Nyou turning into a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just like Dio now, a\Ndisgusting soulless vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're only feeling it now, the change\Nmust have started after I stabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a vow to protect\Nyour lord and master, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the hold up,\NCool Ice? I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go to hell, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've got to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was that my imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it really...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to sit and ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that matters now is making\Nit upstairs and finding Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fall apart after\Neverything they sacrificed.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.82,0:09:08.20,SC44 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,680)\pos(510,543)}Avdol and Iggy have died
