Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan, 43 days had passed since Jojo and\Nthe others began their journey to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosa, stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get out.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.35,SC44 Sign 2 White,whiteblack,0,0,0,,{\pos(544.8,307.2)}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.35,SC44 Sign 2 Blue,whiteblack,0,0,0,,{\pos(1188,285.2)}Soba Midokoro
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madame Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to overstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's now really the best\Ntime to stop at a sober stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been to Japan in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to grab a quick bite\Nbefore visiting my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hon, would you be a dear\Nand hold on to my turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Madame, you mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Places such as these are\Nfor common businessmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies of your pedigree should\Nonly dine at fine restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Madame,\Ndon't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lighten up, Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so quaint, I just have to record it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the local flavor is simply to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this'll be a good shot.
