Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roses, judging by the\Nmadame's cavalier attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you've not told\Nher about Holly's condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the holdup, Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm right behind you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't uttered a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as she knows, her daughter is\Nbattling a severe case of pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've worked for the Joestar\Nfamily for the past 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Miss Holly, I've known her since\Nshe was a little girl in grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that I have to tell her the\Ntruth, but I just don't have the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even coming to Japan hasn't\Ngiven me the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly doesn't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's not saved, she'll likely\Ndie within the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer that I\Ntold Madam Joestar, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've made my bed with the\Nfalsehoods I've told the madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I have to lie in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be the one to inform her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you absolutely sure\Nthe curse afflicting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Holly will be lifted\Nif Dio is killed? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's demise will end this. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polly's body is reacting to energy\Nfrom something known as a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only people with said stands\Ncan observe the phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put simply, Dio's dark energy\Nis slowly destroying her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Madam cannot see the stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, she'll have to bear witness to\Nher only daughter in the throes of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must know the time\Nfor secrets is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of sulking around,\Ncome have some curry udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please listen, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something that\NI need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I must get some footage of this delightful\Nlittle health drink vending machine.
