Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to get you one, Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Joestar, you have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite appearances, those aren't drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, please, you have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, it's about Miss Holly. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this Japanese\Nman's unique fashion sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a big smile if you would!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission\Nto videotape me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, madam, get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking that camera\Nfrom you before you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a damn foreign hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking to see some\Nblood today, you rich bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to lay\Nanother finger on Madam.
