Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, you should try learning a\Nbit more about Japanese culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell her Miss Holly\Nonly has a few days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would break her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the last thing\NI would ever want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost arrived, and\NI still haven't told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't put this off any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll soon be in sight of the Cujo house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs to hear this from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I know there's\Nsomething you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to tell me you don't\Nneed to pretend anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of what's\Ntroubling you Roses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my daughter's life is in\Ngrave danger isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called Holly from New\NYork a few times she put
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a brave face and\Npretended to be cheerful and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She tried her best to convince\Nme it was only a mild cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever Joseph phoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he would tell me his business\Ntrip kept him very busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that I had nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I knew they were keeping\Nsomething important from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down, I knew something terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was happening to my daughter and husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been married to\NJoseph for 50 years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my sweet holly is\Nmy own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never pressed them for more information\Nbecause I was afraid of what they'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted nothing more than\Nto see my precious daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the thought of what I'd\Nfind here was almost too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this much, so you also\Nhave the right to know the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it stands, your daughter only\Nhas a few days left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others went to Egypt\Nto end the source of her illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's been no news for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, can you find it in your heart\Nto forgive me for not telling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing we\Ncould do for Miss Holly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I wanted to spare you from\Nthe pain, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was cruel of me not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear any more\Nof that foolishness, Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how grim things seem, there's\Nstill one thing we can do for Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me very carefully, Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, the one thing we can\Ndo for my daughter is have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Neverything that's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here's what I do know:\NJoseph and my grandson, Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are putting their lives on\Nthe line in the hope of saving
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly and I believe they will\Nfind a way to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never failed me, not once in the\N50 years I have known him. He's kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every promise he's made since\Nthe two of us met in Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he's made up his mind to do something,\Nnothing in this world can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest and believe in\NJotaro and your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be better before you know it, and\Nour family will be together once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Joestar, Miss Holly,\Nplease hang in there.
