Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't laugh, but knowing they got\Nwhat they deserve feels so satisfying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what the fools get\Nfor calling me a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least now we know\NI wasn't one after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly defeat the\NJoestars using that pathetic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, but that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a chance to fight them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're merely an ordinary vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.52,0:17:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd best stay out of our way\Nor we might end up killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do try to behave yourself, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who finishes off Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something up ahead, to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't suck my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Easy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run away anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't Dio's minions, and\Nwe're certainly not vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the good guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just calm down and\Nlet us help you. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good guys good guys\Nyou're really not those
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,evil vampires you're\Nactually going to help
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me get away from here\Nthat's right we're good
