Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,real good at punching evil in the\Nface if you still want help we'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happy to oblige we'll I'll help by\Nsending you on a one-way trip to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Help! Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power is impossible to crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would this power have anything to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the face of a woman on\Nthe back of your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For future reference,\Nwhen you flip your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should make sure\Nyour hands match, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where is Dio's room? Out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, try not to knock him unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can take us to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just like those other guys,\Nso you'll meet the same fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio's powers made me immortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll use all of it\Nto rip you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So unless I heard wrong, you\Njust said you were an immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a vampire like Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use you as a practice dummy for\Nwhen I fight against the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you really are immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but vampire or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can still rip you into little pieces\Nand scatter them around the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you taking us to Dio or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is about to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but can I at\Nleast ask you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you know the other\Nstand users used to call me loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's got some pretty nice curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.22,0:22:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can walk and even\Njump around if I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It still hurts a bit, but now's not\Nthe time to worry about a little pain.
