Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally come out, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something you need to hear first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he playing games with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he bring out his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to rethink
